@startuml
title 觸達流程：兩路徑收斂 → 受眾展開 → 發送/重試

actor "行銷人員" as MK
participant "Scheduler\n(campaign)" as SCH
participant "Campaign Consumer\n(campaign)" as CC
queue "Kafka: domain.events" as DE
queue "Kafka: reach.requested" as RR
participant "Orchestrator\n(reach)" as ORC
participant "AudienceResolver\n(reach)" as AR
database "PostgreSQL\n(ReachTask)" as DB
participant "Dispatcher\n(reach)" as DSP
participant "EmailAdapter\n(reach)" as EA
participant "Email Provider" as EP
queue "Kafka: DLQ" as DLQ

== 路徑 1：排程批次 ==
SCH -> SCH : 掃描 RUNNING 活動\n(ShedLock 鎖定 cycle)
SCH -> RR : ReachRequested\n(campaignId, targetSpec, reachPlan, sendCycle)

== 路徑 2：事件觸發 ==
MK -> DE : (電商主站) CartAbandoned
DE -> CC : 消費行為事件
CC -> CC : ReachTriggerEvaluator\n.shouldTrigger(ctx)
CC -> RR : ReachRequested (同一 topic)

== 共同下游：受眾展開與發送 ==
RR -> ORC : 消費 ReachRequested (活動層級)
ORC -> AR : 解析 targetSpec
AR --> ORC : 收件人清單 [N]
ORC -> ORC : 去重 / 頻控
loop 每位收件人
  ORC -> DB : 建立 ReachTask(PENDING)\nunique(campaignId,userId,sendCycle,channel)\nON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
end
ORC -> DSP : 觸發發送

loop 每筆 ReachTask
  DSP -> DB : 取任務 → PROCESSING
  DSP -> EA : send(ReachMessage)
  EA -> EP : 寄送 Email
  alt 成功
    EP --> EA : OK
    EA --> DSP : SendResult(SENT)
    DSP -> DB : ReachTask = SENT
  else 可重試失敗 (429/5xx/timeout)
    EP --> EA : error
    EA --> DSP : retryable
    DSP -> DB : RETRY_SCHEDULED\n(指數退避, 最多 3 次)
  else 重試耗盡 / 不可重試
    DSP -> DB : FAILED
    DSP -> DLQ : 進 dead-letter
  end
end
@enduml
